  "details": "Upon your hand colliding with PhysBones or Dynamic Bones, it would make your VR controller vibrate dependent on the speed of the hand movement (and/or potentially another dynamic factor?).\nI believe this feature is important to VRChat. I've previously used a mod that provided this, and even though it's a relatively small detail, it was a game changer.\nPlaying VRChat was a lot more interesting now, and I could actually relate to the folk who experienced phantom touch. I felt more engaged and for longer. The ability to have this is pretty important to me, as someone with ADHD and doesn't experience phantom touch. This could obviously be a togglable feature too.\nPlease consider! I believe that this change would make a big difference in the total gameplay experience.",
